{"shortDescription":"The South African rand traded around 16.3 per USD, close to the lowest since mid-September, pressured by a firmer US dollar and falling prices of precious metals, particularly gold.Meanwhile, traders digested the South African Reserve Bank’s latest policy decision to raise its key repo rate to 7.25…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["The South African rand traded around 16.3 per USD, close to the lowest since mid-September, pressured by a firmer US dollar and falling prices of precious metals, particularly gold."]},{"type":"p","children":["Meanwhile, traders digested the South African Reserve Bank’s latest policy decision to raise its key repo rate to 7.25%, in line with expectations."]},{"type":"p","children":["The move underscored the central bank’s commitment to bringing inflation back toward its 3% target, with policymakers citing renewed upside risks following the escalation of the Iran war, which pushed up oil prices and dampened the global economic outlook."]},{"type":"p","children":["Policymakers noted South Africa’s economy contracted in Q2, while inflation has increased well above the SARB's target."]},{"type":"p","children":["Earlier data showed headline inflation ticked up to 4.4% in August from 4.3% in July, just below expectations of 4.5%."]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"Forex","args":[{"id":"category","value":"forex"}]},{"title":"Trading Economics","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"trading-economics"}]}],"id":"te_news:586135:0","title":"South African Rand Subdued","published":1790170370,"urgency":2,"link":"https://tradingeconomics.com/south-africa/currency","permission":"preview","relatedSymbols":[{"symbol":"FX:USDZAR","currency-logoid":"country/ZA","base-currency-logoid":"country/US","logo":{"style":"pair","logoid":"country/US","logoid2":"country/ZA"}},{"symbol":"FTMO_OANDA:USDZAR.SIM","currency-logoid":"country/ZA","base-currency-logoid":"country/US","logo":{"style":"pair","logoid":"coun